#: appinstaller.rs:952
msgid "This will take {size} of space on your computer."
msgstr "ይህ በኮምፒውተርዎ ላይ {size} ቦታ ይወስዳል።"

#: appinstaller.rs:954
msgid "The app is downloaded from {source}."
msgstr "መተግበሪያው ከ{source} ይወርዳል።"

#: appinstaller.rs:956
msgid "The app is installed for all users of this computer."
msgstr "መተግበሪያው ለዚህ ኮምፒውተር ሁሉም ተጠቃሚዎች ይጫናል።"

