#: oobe.rs:680
msgid "You can connect later in Settings."
msgstr "በኋላ በቅንብሮች ውስጥ መገናኘት ይችላሉ።"

#: oobe.rs:689
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "ተገናኝቷል"

#: oobe.rs:689
msgid "Not Connected"
msgstr "አልተገናኘም"

#: oobe.rs:717
msgid "No networks found"
msgstr "ምንም አውታረ መረብ አልተገኘም"

#: oobe.rs:746
msgid "Internet"
msgstr "በይነመረብ"

#: oobe.rs:777
msgid "Create Your Account"
msgstr "መለያዎን ይፍጠሩ"

#: oobe.rs:777
msgid "You will be the administrator of this computer, with full root access through sudo."
msgstr "በsudo በኩል ሙሉ የroot መዳረሻ ያለዎት የዚህ ኮምፒውተር አስተዳዳሪ ይሆናሉ።"

#: oobe.rs:780
msgid "Full Name"
msgstr "ሙሉ ስም"

#: oobe.rs:781
msgid "Username"
msgstr "የተጠቃሚ ስም"

#: oobe.rs:782
msgid "Password"
msgstr "የይለፍ ቃል"

#: oobe.rs:783
msgid "Confirm Password"
msgstr "የይለፍ ቃሉን ያረጋግጡ"

#: oobe.rs:784
msgid "Log In Automatically"
msgstr "ራስ-ሰር መግቢያ"

#: oobe.rs:784
msgid "Skip the login screen when the computer starts"
msgstr "ኮምፒውተሩ ሲጀምር የመግቢያ ገጹን ዝለል"

#: oobe.rs:791
msgid "Existing Home Folders"
msgstr "ያሉ የቤት አቃፊዎች"

#: oobe.rs:791
msgid "Use the same username to keep using a folder kept from a previous installation."
msgstr "የቀድሞውን ጭነት አቃፊ መጠቀም ለመቀጠል ተመሳሳዩን የተጠቃሚ ስም ይጠቀሙ።"

#: oobe.rs:795
msgid "Use"
msgstr "ተጠቀም"

#: oobe.rs:805
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "የላቀ"

#: oobe.rs:806
msgid "Computer Name"
msgstr "የኮምፒውተር ስም"

#: oobe.rs:808
msgid "Set a Root Password"
msgstr "የroot የይለፍ ቃል አዘጋጅ"

#: oobe.rs:809
msgid "Allows logging in as root directly. Without it, use sudo with your own password."
msgstr "በቀጥታ እንደ root መግባትን ይፈቅዳል። ያለ እሱ sudoን ከራስዎ የይለፍ ቃል ጋር ይጠቀሙ።"

#: oobe.rs:813
msgid "Root Password"
msgstr "የroot የይለፍ ቃል"

#: oobe.rs:814
msgid "Confirm Root Password"
msgstr "የroot የይለፍ ቃሉን ያረጋግጡ"

#: oobe.rs:838
msgid "Enter your name."
msgstr "ስምዎን ያስገቡ።"

#: oobe.rs:840
msgid "Choose a username."
msgstr "የተጠቃሚ ስም ይምረጡ።"

#: oobe.rs:842
msgid "This username is already used by the system."
msgstr "ይህ የተጠቃሚ ስም አስቀድሞ በስርዓቱ ጥቅም ላይ ነው።"

#: oobe.rs:845
msgid "This username is reserved by the system."
msgstr "ይህ የተጠቃሚ ስም ለስርዓቱ የተያዘ ነው።"

#: oobe.rs:847
msgid "Usernames use lowercase letters, digits, - and _, and start with a letter."
msgstr "የተጠቃሚ ስሞች ትንንሽ የላቲን ፊደላት፣ አሃዞች፣ - እና _ ይይዛሉ፣ በፊደልም ይጀምራሉ።"

#: oobe.rs:850
msgid "Choose a password."
msgstr "የይለፍ ቃል ይምረጡ።"

#: oobe.rs:852
msgid "The passwords do not match."
msgstr "የይለፍ ቃሎቹ አይዛመዱም።"

#: oobe.rs:854
msgid "The computer name may contain letters, digits and dashes."
msgstr "የኮምፒውተሩ ስም ፊደላት፣ አሃዞች እና ሰረዞች ሊይዝ ይችላል።"

#: oobe.rs:856
msgid "Enter the root password twice."
msgstr "የroot የይለፍ ቃሉን ሁለት ጊዜ ያስገቡ።"

#: oobe.rs:862
msgid "Tip: a password with 8 or more characters is much safer."
msgstr "ጠቃሚ ምክር: 8 ወይም ከዚያ በላይ ቁምፊዎች ያለው የይለፍ ቃል በጣም ደህንነቱ የተጠበቀ ነው።"

#: oobe.rs:942
msgid "Account"
msgstr "መለያ"

#: oobe.rs:960
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "ጨለማ"

#: oobe.rs:960
msgid "Light"
msgstr "ብርሃን"

#: oobe.rs:968
msgid "Make It Yours"
msgstr "የራስዎ ያድርጉት"

#: oobe.rs:968
msgid "Pick a style, an accent color and a wallpaper. You see every change right away."
msgstr "ቅጥ፣ የአጽንዖት ቀለም እና የግድግዳ ወረቀት ይምረጡ። እያንዳንዱ ለውጥ ወዲያውኑ ይታያል።"

#: oobe.rs:971
msgid "Style"
msgstr "ቅጥ"

#: oobe.rs:991
msgid "Accent Color"
msgstr "የአጽንዖት ቀለም"

#: oobe.rs:1034
msgid "Wallpaper"
msgstr "የግድግዳ ወረቀት"

#: oobe.rs:1078
msgid "Customize"
msgstr "አብጅ"

#: oobe.rs:1085
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "ግላዊነት"

#: oobe.rs:1085
msgid "Choose which features may use information about you. You can change this at any time in Settings."
msgstr "የትኞቹ ባህሪያት ስለእርስዎ መረጃ መጠቀም እንደሚችሉ ይምረጡ። ይህን በማንኛውም ጊዜ በቅንብሮች ውስጥ መቀየር ይችላሉ።"

#: oobe.rs:1088
msgid "Location Services"
msgstr "የአካባቢ አገልግሎቶች"

#: oobe.rs:1089
msgid "Allows apps such as Maps and Weather to find your approximate location, using nearby Wi-Fi networks."
msgstr "እንደ Maps እና Weather ያሉ መተግበሪያዎች በአቅራቢያ ባሉ የWi-Fi አውታረ መረቦች ግምታዊ አካባቢዎን እንዲያገኙ ያስችላል።"

#: oobe.rs:1093
msgid "Automatic Time Zone"
msgstr "ራስ-ሰር የሰዓት ሰቅ"

#: oobe.rs:1094
msgid "Uses your location to keep the time zone right when you travel."
msgstr "በጉዞ ላይ የሰዓት ሰቁን ትክክል ለማድረግ አካባቢዎን ይጠቀማል።"

#: oobe.rs:1127
msgid "_Finish Setup"
msgstr "ማዋቀሩን ጨርስ(_F)"

#: oobe.rs:1132
msgid "Your Disk Is Encrypted"
msgstr "ዲስክዎ ተመስጥሯል"

#: oobe.rs:1132
msgid "Your data is protected. The passphrase is asked every time the computer starts."
msgstr "ውሂብዎ የተጠበቀ ነው። ኮምፒውተሩ በጀመረ ቁጥር የይለፍ ሐረግ ይጠየቃል።"

#: oobe.rs:1135
msgid "Disk Encryption"
msgstr "የዲስክ ምስጠራ"

#: oobe.rs:1135
msgid "Encryption protects your data if the computer is lost or stolen."
msgstr "ኮምፒውተሩ ቢጠፋ ወይም ቢሰረቅ ምስጠራ ውሂብዎን ይጠብቃል።"

#: oobe.rs:1137
msgid "Not available on this installation"
msgstr "በዚህ ጭነት ላይ አይገኝም"

#: oobe.rs:1143
msgid "Encryption protects your files if the computer is lost or stolen. Without the passphrase, nobody can read the disk."
msgstr "ኮምፒውተሩ ቢጠፋ ወይም ቢሰረቅ ምስጠራ ፋይሎችዎን ይጠብቃል። ያለ የይለፍ ሐረጉ ማንም ዲስኩን ማንበብ አይችልም።"

#: oobe.rs:1146
msgid "Encrypt the Disk"
msgstr "ዲስኩን መስጥር"

#: oobe.rs:1147
msgid "The passphrase is asked every time the computer starts."
msgstr "ኮምፒውተሩ በጀመረ ቁጥር የይለፍ ሐረግ ይጠየቃል።"

#: oobe.rs:1155
msgid "Encryption starts at the next restart"
msgstr "ምስጠራ በሚቀጥለው ዳግም ጅምር ይጀምራል"

#: oobe.rs:1156
msgid "Your disk is then encrypted in the background while you use the computer. If the passphrase is lost, the data cannot be recovered by anyone."
msgstr "ከዚያም ኮምፒውተሩን እየተጠቀሙ ሳሉ ዲስኩ ከበስተጀርባ ይመሰጠራል። የይለፍ ሐረጉ ቢጠፋ ማንም ውሂቡን መመለስ አይችልም።"

#: oobe.rs:1253
msgid "Preparing MAN"
msgstr "MAN በመዘጋጀት ላይ"

#: oobe.rs:1254
msgid "Getting everything ready…"
msgstr "ሁሉንም በማዘጋጀት ላይ…"

#: oobe.rs:1259
msgid "_Reboot"
msgstr "እንደገና አስጀምር(_R)"

#: oobe.rs:1261
msgid "_Go Back"
msgstr "ተመለስ(_G)"

#: oobe.rs:1275
msgid "Preparing"
msgstr "በመዘጋጀት ላይ"

#: oobe.rs:1288
msgid "Setup Log"
msgstr "የማዋቀር ምዝግብ"

#: oobe.rs:1320
msgid "All Done!"
msgstr "ሁሉም ዝግጁ ነው!"

#: oobe.rs:1330
msgid "Something Went Wrong"
msgstr "የሆነ ችግር ተፈጥሯል"

#: recovery.rs:113
msgid "MAN Recovery"
msgstr "የMAN መልሶ ማግኛ"

#: recovery.rs:114
msgid "Restore your system, reinstall MAN or open a Terminal. First, an administrator of this computer signs in."
msgstr "ስርዓትህን መልስ፣ MANን እንደገና ጫን ወይም ተርሚናል ክፈት። መጀመሪያ የዚህ ኮምፒውተር አስተዳዳሪ ይግባ።"

#: recovery.rs:122
msgid "Administrator"
msgstr "አስተዳዳሪ"

#: recovery.rs:131
msgid "No installed system was found on this disk. You can reinstall MAN."
msgstr "በዚህ ዲስክ ላይ የተጫነ ስርዓት አልተገኘም። MANን እንደገና መጫን ትችላለህ።"

#: recovery.rs:198
msgid "This computer has MAN {version}."
msgstr "ይህ ኮምፒውተር MAN {version} አለው።"

#: recovery.rs:199
msgid "What Would You Like to Do?"
msgstr "ምን ማድረግ ትፈልጋለህ?"

#: recovery.rs:202
msgid "Restore a Snapshot"
msgstr "ቅጽበታዊ ገጽ እይታ መልስ"

#: recovery.rs:202
msgid "Your system broke? Go back to a moment when everything worked. Your files stay."
msgstr "ስርዓትህ ተበላሽቷል? ሁሉም ነገር ይሠራበት ወደነበረበት ጊዜ ተመለስ። ፋይሎችህ ይቆያሉ።"

#: recovery.rs:203
msgid "Download the newest MAN and install it again. Your files, accounts and settings stay."
msgstr "አዲሱን MAN አውርደህ እንደገና ጫን። ፋይሎችህ፣ መለያዎችህ እና ቅንብሮችህ ይቆያሉ።"

#: recovery.rs:204
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "ተርሚናል"

#: recovery.rs:204
msgid "For experts: type commands with full control of the computer."
msgstr "ለባለሙያዎች፦ በኮምፒውተሩ ሙሉ ቁጥጥር ትዕዛዞችን ተይብ።"

#: recovery.rs:207
msgid "There are no snapshots on this computer."
msgstr "በዚህ ኮምፒውተር ላይ ቅጽበታዊ ገጽ እይታዎች የሉም።"

#: recovery.rs:240
msgid "Choose a moment when everything worked. The files in your home folder stay as they are now."
msgstr "ሁሉም ነገር ይሠራበት የነበረውን ጊዜ ምረጥ። በቤት አቃፊህ ያሉ ፋይሎች አሁን እንዳሉ ይቆያሉ።"

#: recovery.rs:257
msgid "Restore “{name}”?"
msgstr "“{name}”ን ልመልስ?"

#: recovery.rs:258
msgid "Your system goes back to how it was on {date}. Your files stay. The system as it is now is kept as a snapshot, so you can come back to it."
msgstr "ስርዓትህ በ{date} ወደነበረበት ይመለሳል። ፋይሎችህ ይቆያሉ። ስርዓቱ አሁን እንዳለ እንደ ቅጽበታዊ ገጽ እይታ ይቀመጣል፣ ስለዚህ ወደ እሱ መመለስ ትችላለህ።"

#: recovery.rs:261
msgid "_Restore"
msgstr "መልስ(_R)"

#: recovery.rs:270
msgid "Restoring Your System"
msgstr "ስርዓትህን በመመለስ ላይ"

#: recovery.rs:275
msgid "Your system was restored. Restart to use it."
msgstr "ስርዓትህ ተመልሷል። ለመጠቀም እንደገና አስጀምር።"

#: recovery.rs:283
msgid "MAN Recovery downloads the newest MAN. Connect to a network first."
msgstr "የMAN መልሶ ማግኛ አዲሱን MAN ያወርዳል። መጀመሪያ ከአውታረ መረብ ጋር ተገናኝ።"

#: recovery.rs:388
msgid "Looking for the newest MAN…"
msgstr "አዲሱን MAN በመፈለግ ላይ…"

#: recovery.rs:394
msgid "Your files, accounts and settings stay."
msgstr "ፋይሎችህ፣ መለያዎችህ እና ቅንብሮችህ ይቆያሉ።"

#: recovery.rs:395
msgid "Apps you installed as Flatpaks stay; other apps you added may need to be installed again."
msgstr "እንደ Flatpak የጫንካቸው መተግበሪያዎች ይቆያሉ፤ ሌሎች ያከልካቸው መተግበሪያዎች እንደገና መጫን ሊያስፈልጋቸው ይችላል።"

#: recovery.rs:396
msgid "The system as it is now is kept as a snapshot."
msgstr "ስርዓቱ አሁን እንዳለ እንደ ቅጽበታዊ ገጽ እይታ ይቀመጣል።"

#: recovery.rs:397
msgid "Keep the computer plugged in. This takes a while."
msgstr "ኮምፒውተሩን ተሰክቶ አቆየው። ይህ ጊዜ ይወስዳል።"

#: recovery.rs:407
msgid "_Reinstall MAN"
msgstr "_MANን እንደገና ጫን"

#: recovery.rs:426
